{"id":"745220753bc390fa","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-comb6-block-design.md","title":"ZFC Comb6 Block Design","display":"df-zfc-comb6-block-design — ZFC Comb6 Block Design","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb6-block-design","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb6-block-design"],"display":"df-zfc-comb6-block-design — ZFC Comb6 Block Design","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-family.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb6-block-design"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb6-block-design</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb6-block-design — ZFC Comb6 Block Design"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-family.md\">../batch08/58-df-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal.md\">58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (point set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq[X]^k\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq[X]^k\\)</span> (block family, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-family.md\">../batch08/58-df-family.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span> (block size)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> (pair-incidence multiplicity/cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6BlockDesign}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6BlockDesign}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}block\\text{-}design} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6BlockDesign}_S(X,\\mathcal B,k,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq[X]^k\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to|\\{B\\in\\mathcal B:x\\in B\\land y\\in B\\}|=\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}block\\text{-}design} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6BlockDesign}_S(X,\\mathcal B,k,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq[X]^k\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to|\\{B\\in\\mathcal B:x\\in B\\land y\\in B\\}|=\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC combinatorial definition.</li>\n<li>The point carrier is written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> so that it is not confused with the ambient universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc